      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SUNSET CLARICE (1) was out of the placings last time when sixth at this track (30.19) but scored four back at this track (29.86). Form here at the trip sound including six wins. Goes well out of this box with a win and four minor placings. Better than the latest effort and deserves another chance. BEZZECCHI (8) ran fifth in a OPEN last time, copping a check in the run and finishing 4 lengths from the winner over 520m at this track. Has three wins from Box 8. Rates a key player and gets chance to atone. FROMELLES POPPY (5) won again in an impressive display after stalking the pace to make it two on end, scoring by a neck (30.10) at this track over 520m. Can continue on with her winning form. QUEEN OF KUNA (2) should be thereabouts after filling a top-three spot most recently.",
